TABLE EVIDENCE INDEX V2 — SUPERSEDES TABLE_EVIDENCE_INDEX.log
The missing holdout raw inputs have now been supplied and verified: holdout-reproduction-inputs-728444c5.zip, 677 hashed files.
Fresh LODO/LOFO numerical reproductions are included; old operator-transcript exports are retained only for historical provenance and comparison. Read the reproduced reports for agreement/discrepancy checks rather than assuming exact historical RNG equivalence.
The local ZIP contains raw numerical inputs and standalone main/LODO/LOFO numerical reproduction scripts. It does not include model weights or training datasets sufficient to rerun model fitting; no retraining is required for these statistical tables.
Overleaf: upload consolidated .log reports only. Keep the raw archives and reproduction scripts locally; do not unpack hundreds of input files into Overleaf.

Other evidence coverage is unchanged: archived experiment/report/data sources, initial matched comparison, timing/baselines, frozen dataset counts, initialization Taylor report and MIC source summaries. The MIC summary export does not itself rerun the estimator/permutation pipeline. No claim of fresh independent recomputation of every descriptive table or original model training is made.

